        {
          "book": "GEN",
          "chapter": 38,
          "verse": 9
        }
      ],
      "en": "Onan knew that the offspring wouldn’t be his; and when he went in to his brother’s wife, he spilled his semen on the ground, lest he should give offspring to his brother.",
      "ko": "오난이 그 씨가 자기 것이 되지 않을줄 알므로 형수에게 들어갔을 때에 형에게 아들을 얻게 아니하려고 땅에 설정하매",
      "source_text_hash": "2a6733a35f8c44c0d271586ddd6c53b2d05459d7fc7284b290f32f261adfc129",
      "translation_text_hash": "569b0e6df4c63f8422265b0c13c7d53f7e95a44925db62a7983039b20f0c8cc8",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
