      "en": "The thing which he did was evil in the LORD’s sight, and he killed him also.",
      "ko": "그 일이 여호와 목전에 악하므로 여호와께서 그도 죽이시니",
      "source_text_hash": "dd6615867066351a7e00e04d3c53a22690ed248a79bc1d322c186a71dcb5f968",
      "translation_text_hash": "a9925430e74b96a55da296b2ede7622974ea5ed7f4d0ad910552bc30180d42a1",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
