      "en": "About three months later, Judah was told, “Tamar, your daughter-in-law, has played the prostitute. Moreover, behold, she is with child by prostitution.” Judah said, “Bring her out, and let her be burned.”",
      "ko": "석달쯤 후에 혹이 유다에게 고하여 가로되 네 며느리 다말이 행음하였고 그 행음함을 인하여 잉태하였느니라 유다가 가로되 그를 끌어내어 불사르라",
      "source_text_hash": "649d63cc902f8d7f5c9e14d46300ff5c0a22cf40acea0e85e0a25b5910ae3fec",
      "translation_text_hash": "3e06181ab5acc2e6cad54e8996d854766785d74a6a8c86f4871cce712b8a190f",
